---
import Layout from '../../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../../styles/ai.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Grok 4.6 — xAI — Rycode"
  description="Prior Grok flagship on the API. Still documented."
  variant="ai"
>
  <article class="ai-model">
    <p class="ai-model-kicker">Frontier models</p>
    <h1 class="ai-model-title">Grok 4.6</h1>
    <p class="ai-model-dek">Prior flagship on the API. Still documented. Model id: grok-4.6. Current lead is <a href="/ai/models/xai/grok-4-7/">Grok 4.7</a>.</p>
    <hr class="ai-model-rule" />

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Training</h2>
    <p>Knowledge cutoff: 1 Feb 2026 (docs note on the models page). Parameter count, FLOPs, dataset mix, and any RL recipe tied to this SKU: UNKNOWN. Do not invent scores or params.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Inference</h2>
    <p>Reasoning: low / medium / high (default) / xhigh. Batch: not supported. Modalities: text, image → text.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Context</h2>
    <p>500k context. Max output tokens: UNKNOWN except the published “no text output limit” note on the Grok 4.6 overview.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Pricing</h2>
    <p>Per 1M tokens, as published on docs.x.ai/developers/models, 13 Sep 2026. Long-context tier applies when the prompt is ≥ 200k tokens (higher rate for all tokens in that request).</p>
    <div class="ai-model-table-wrap">
      <table class="ai-model-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Band</th>
            <th scope="col">Input</th>
            <th scope="col">Cached</th>
            <th scope="col">Output</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>&lt; 200k</td><td>$2.00</td><td>$0.50</td><td>$6.00</td></tr>
          <tr><td>≥ 200k</td><td>$4.00</td><td>$1.00</td><td>$12.00</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>Re-check the live models page before you quote a dollar.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Benchmarking</h2>
    <p>UNKNOWN on the models pages fetched for this card. Marketing says industry-leading coding / non-hallucination / tool calling and points at an announcement for “benchmark figures.” Do not invent scores. Pull only from that announcement page if you open it.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Hardware</h2>
    <p>Per-SKU training or serving silicon: UNKNOWN. Grok training narratives name Colossus. That is a campus, not a chip fab. See <a href="/ai/hardware/memphis-colossus/">Memphis / Colossus</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Sources</h2>
    <ul class="ai-model-sources">
      <li><a href="https://docs.x.ai/developers/models">Models</a> (fetched 13 Sep 2026)</li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.x.ai/developers/models/grok-4.6">grok-4.6</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.x.ai/developers/grok-4-6">Grok 4.6 overview</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.x.ai/developers/pricing">Pricing</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://x.ai/api">x.ai/api</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Layout>
